<column gap="16" padding="24" grow="1">
  <text size="heading">Kakuriyo</text>
  <text>Local encrypted vault — Zig host service connected.</text>
  <column gap="8">
    <text size="heading">What works now</text>
    <text>Envelope crypto (Argon2id + XChaCha20-Poly1305) in vault.zig</text>
    <text>vault.* dispatch over the effects channel (create/unlock/save/lock/change)</text>
    <text>Smoke + mutation gates prove the file lifecycle offline</text>
  </column>
  <column gap="8">
    <text size="heading">Session UI</text>
    <text>Unlock / save / lock screens wait on the TS compiled-lane fix (0.8.3).</text>
    <text>Until then, verify with: nix-shell --run "npm run gate"</text>
  </column>
  <button label="Ping host seam" on-press="ping_attempt:{lastPing}" />
</column>
